window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A Enemies to Lovers, Fated Mates Menage Shifter Romance</p> <p>She never wanted a mate… now fate has given her two.</p> <p>Adriana never asked to be turned into a wolf. Betrayed and forced into a world she never chose, she has dedicated her life to the Shadow Sisters, a secretive group of warriors rescuing women from peril. She swore she would never be bound again, until fate throws not one, but two fated mates in her path.</p> <p>Greg, a compassionate pack doctor from the Hamptons, offers her healing and safety. Decker, the ruthless commander of the guard, awakens a fire in her soul with his raw dominance and fierce loyalty. One soothes, the other ignites, but Adriana refuses to be claimed.</p> <p>Yet the past refuses to stay buried. The wolf who turned her still haunts her, holding a dark tether she’s desperate to break. Determined to end his hold over her once and for all, Adriana launches a bold attack, only to find herself in deeper danger than she ever imagined.</p> <p>Now, Greg and Decker must set aside their rivalry and fight together to save the woman destined to be theirs. But as enemies close in and Adriana faces an impossible choice, one question remains.</p> <p>Can she surrender to fate and claim the love she never wanted…or risk losing everything?</p>"; 
